{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghosts Of The Past follows the fate of nine people hired to find a map that unlocks the secret of eternal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story based RPG, Secrets of the Lost, will tell the tale from a different character's point of view across numerous episodes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story based adventure:</strong> Follow the adventures of the company of nine as they embark on a dangerous quest; will they find external life or lose their own?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/s1gif_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1745427028\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Characters with unique skills</strong>: The skills of a miner, hunter, archer and even a pirate will be playable (depending on the episode).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/s1_gif_3_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1745427028\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-based battles: </strong>Face off against bandits, guards and monsters that the world had forgotten.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/s1gif2_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1745427028\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3414690?t=1745427028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3414690?t=1745427028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/8c7553de333f7cacfbc1421e7509234f275654da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745427028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/8c7553de333f7cacfbc1421e7509234f275654da/cap